<title>USA: Mazda June US car sales rise.</title>
<headline>Mazda June US car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mazda Motor Corp</p>
<p>			Jun 1-30, 1997     Jun 1-30, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    12,181	     7,635	    +59.5</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   4,127	     3,648	    +13.1</p>
<p> Import Car		 9,390	     8,625	     +8.9</p>
<p> Import Truck	     1,364	     1,193	    +14.3</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Jun 30, 1997 Jan 1-Jun 30, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    47,107	    50,336	     -5.8</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  18,922	    22,275	    -14.5</p>
<p> Import Car		49,000	    55,266	    -10.8</p>
<p> Import Truck	     6,839	     7,079	     -2.8</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 25 in latest month vs 25, 153 for year to date vs 154 in year ago.</p>
</text>
